type: software
title: "CHSH Lab: Bell inequality experiments and rebuttal"
abstract: >
  CHSH Lab is a static website presenting an interactive rebuttal to claims
  of Bell inequality violation without entanglement, with browser-side CHSH
  statistics demos and a formal paper view.
